ried) = 11 (Write down 1, carry over 1).\n- **Hundred thousands place:** 9 + 8 + 1 (carried) = 18 (Write down 8, carry over 1).\n- **Millions place:** 4 + 9 + 1 (carried) = 14 (Write down 4, carry over 1).\n- **Hundred millions place:** 6 + 6 + 1 (carried) = 13 (Write down 13).\n\n3. **Combine all the results:**.\n\n```.\n  649,239,260.\n+ 698,773,125.\n--------------.\n 1,348,012,385.\n```.\n\n# Answer:.Therefore, the answer is"]]
